; A sort key naming a function that neither the item nor the report
; defines is an error, for postings and for accounts alike.

2024/01/01 Beta
    Expenses:Food          $5.00
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/02 Alpha
    Expenses:Rent          $30.00
    Assets:Cash

test reg Expenses -S no_such_key -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  no_such_key
  ^^^^^^^^^^^
Error: Unknown identifier 'no_such_key'
end test

test bal Expenses -S no_such_key -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  no_such_key
  ^^^^^^^^^^^
Error: Unknown identifier 'no_such_key'
end test
